  "releaseNotes": "======================================================\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n Version 10.0.0\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n======================================================\n\n\n==========================================\nNew Features\n==========================================\n- Add a standalone caching extension with ICachingHandlerFactory and CacheCow-based filesystem stores (#308)\n    ○ Introduce ICachingHandlerFactory to abstract caching handler creation and move CacheCow-based caching to new Api.Rest.Caching project\n    ○ Update RestClient and builder to use the new factory, removing direct CacheCow dependencies\n    ○ Reduces overhead in browser scenarios, since caching is handled by the browser itself\n    ○ Move CacheCow-based filesystem cache stores from Api.Rest to new project",
